<title>USA: American General Hospitality sets dividend.</title>
<headline>American General Hospitality sets dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>American General Hospitality Corp said its board has declared a cash distribution for the fourth quarter of $0.4075 per share, payable January 30, record December 30.</p>
<p>The company set its initial distribution in September and paid $0.2746 per share for a two month period, based on the pro rata rate of $0.4075.</p>
